{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はすごく暑かったですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/25/8325613/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急に夏になったみたいです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず乃木坂46がHTC Jのアンバサダーを務めさせていただくことが決まりました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/25/8325613/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にうれしいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金曜日はその記者発表がありました(o^∀^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HTC J の魅力が多くの方々に広まるように、精一杯頑張っていきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/25/8325613/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして日曜日は指原さんの地元の大分に伺い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプーシャンプーを配ってきました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46のことを知らなくてもあたたかく受け取ってくださったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばって！と声をかけてくださる方々もいてうれしかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/25/8325613/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりしたのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大分の空港で荷物のターンテーブルにうにのお寿司が載ってたクルクル..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回転寿司かいっ(^。^;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作り物だったけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/25/8325613/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜夜の乃木どこは、モデル力チェックでした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表情を出すときのポイントなどを教わったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから生かせたらいいなと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/25/8325613/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は表紙の撮影という設定に挑戦しましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが見てる中っていうのは緊張するっ！ちょっと固くなっちゃった(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもいつか本当にできたらいいなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/25/8325613/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日4/23はまあやの誕生日ヾ(´・∀・)ノ << Happy Birthday！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはすごく優しくて、方向オンチの私を迎えにきてくれるということもありました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/25/8325613/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"f^_^;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが笑ってると私も楽しいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/25/8325613/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から発売のストリートジャックに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりん・ななみん・まいやん・生駒ちゃん・かなりんと6人で載せていただいてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでギュギュっと密着して撮影して、わちゃわちゃ楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/25/8325613/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもきれいに撮っていただいているので、ぜひ見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/25/8325613/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/25/8325613/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}